{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"Empire City was recently renamed. It was originally New Ampsterhold, A dutch dwarven settlement. As the area began to prosper, a group of Scottish elves from Glasgow (Commonly called weegies) came into a mutually beneficial alliance with the dwarves. Both races we able to act in a symbiotic way. The dwarves building strong towers, and the elves covering it in lush magical greenery, with energy drawn from a natural convergence of ley lines beneath Manhattan. The weegies gave rise to ferry town, where the commute to and from.","created_at":"2021-07-11T00:23:39.762000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863576238638235678","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
