{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"Hampstead grew up around the Airship port, but the Red Coats have enacted the quartering act leading to the area becoming burdened by toxic magic and a befouled atmosphere.","created_at":"2021-07-11T00:27:18.872000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T00:27:28.025000Z","id":"863577157653757952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
